hadiths[65]{hadithnumber,text}:
"591","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab aurat apne shauhar ke bistar se alag ho to farishte us par la'nat karte hain yahan tak ke woh wapas aae."
"592","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni biwi ko apne bistar par bulae aur woh inkar kare, phir woh us par ghusse mein raat guzare to farishte us par subah tak la'nat karte hain."
"593","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Apni auladon ko chhup kar qatl na karo. Kyunke ghaylah ka qatl sawar ko pa leta hai aur use us ke ghode se gira deta hai.'"
"594","[AI-translation] Un ke walid (Amr bin Maimun bin Mihran) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Umm Kulsum bint Uqbah Zubair bin Awwam ke nikah mein thin. Rawi ne kaha: To woh namaz ke liye nikle jabke unhen dard zeh ne pakad liya tha aur unhon ne use chhupaya. To unhon ne kaha: Mere dil ko ek talaq se khush karo. To unhon ne unhen talaq di. To woh wapas aae aur woh bachcha jan chuki thin. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur Aap se poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kitab apni muddat ko pahunch chuki; use usi se paigham do.' To unhon ne kaha: Us ne mujhe dhoka diya; Allah use dhoka de."
"595","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis ki do biwiyan hon aur woh un mein se ek ki taraf jhuke doosri par, woh Qayamat ke din aaega jabke us ka ek pahlu gira hua hoga."
"596","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar Bani Israil na hote to gosht na sadta aur khana kharab na hota. Aur agar Hawwa na hotin to aurat apne shauhar se khiyanat na karti.'"
"597","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aurat aurat se jism na milae, aur mard mard se jism na milae, aur bachcha bachche se jism na milae.'"
"598","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo khadim ko us ke ghar walon par bhadkae woh ham mein se nahin. Aur jo aurat ko us ke shauhar par bigade woh ham mein se nahin.'"
"599","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke aurat us ki phuphi par nikah ki jae, aur phuphi us ke bhai ki beti par nikah ki jae."
"600","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke aurat us ki phuphi par nikah ki jae, aur phuphi us ke bhai ki beti par nikah ki jae. Aur aurat us ki khala par nikah na ki jae, aur khala us ke bhai ki beti par nikah na ki jae. Aur chhoti badi par nikah na ki jae, aur badi chhoti par nikah na ki jae."
"601","[AI-translation] Aamir se Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind riwayat hai."
"602","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Har khutba jis mein shahadat na ho woh kate hue hath ki manind hai.'"
"603","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Islam mein shighar nahin hai. Aur woh yeh hai ke aurat doosri aurat ke mahr ke badle nikah ki jae; woh kahe: Mujh se nikah karo aur main tum se nikah karunga baghair mahr ke; to wohi shighar hai.'"
"604","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ko khane ki da'wat di jae to use chahiye ke qabool kare. Phir ya to woh khae, aur ya woh dua kare. Phir jab qasid us se pahle dakhil ho to wohi us ki ijazat hai; aur agar woh us se pahle dakhil ho to use chahiye ke ijazat mange.'"
"605","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rabi' bint Mu'awwiz bin Afra (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Mere nikah ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas tashreef laae. To Aap mere bistar ki jagah baithe. Aur mere paas do laundiyan thin jo duff baja rahi thin aur mere un baapon ka nauha kar rahi thin jo Badr mein shaheed hue the. To un donon ne apne qaul mein kaha: Aur ham mein Nabi hai jo janta hai jo aaj aur kal mein hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Raha yeh to use na kaho.'"
"606","[AI-translation] Un ki khala (Ibrahim bin Maisarah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne unhen ek aurat se bataya jo sachchi hai. Us ne kaha: Jab mere walid zamana jahiliyyat mein ek ghazwe mein the, woh garmi mein the. To ek aadmi ne kaha: Jo mujhe do joote de main us se apni pahli paida hone wali beti ka nikah karunga. To mere walid ne apne dono joote utare aur us ki taraf phenk diye. To us aadmi ke han ek ladki paida hui, phir woh baligh hui. To mere walid ne kaha: Mere ghar walon ko mere paas jama karo. To unhon ne kaha: Mahr lao. To mere walid ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main tumhen un donon jooton se ziyada nahin dunga jo main ne tumhen diye the. To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main use tumhen siwae mahr ke nahin dunga. To mere walid Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur Aap se is ke bare mein poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya main tumhen us se behtar na bataun? Use chhod do, use chhod do; tum gunahgar nahin hoge aur na apne saathi ko gunahgar karoge.' To mere walid ne use chhod diya."
"607","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Habibah bint Sahl Sabit bin Qais bin Shammas ke nikah mein thin. To unhon ne unhen sakht mara — ya unhon ne kaha: Mara — yahan tak ke un se pahunch gaya. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur Aap ko woh bataya. Aur unhon ne kaha: Na main aur na Sabit (sath rah sakte hain). To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey Sabit! Us se le lo.' To unhon ne kaha: Mere paas woh hai jo us ne mujhe diya tha bi-ainihi. To us se liya gaya, aur unhon ne apne ghar walon ke paas iddat guzari."
"608","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas se guzre jabke ham auraton mein baithi thin aur hamen salam farmaya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Mun'im (ehsan karne wale, shauhar) ki nashukri se bacho.' Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mun'im ki nashukri kya hai? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Shayad tum mein se ek apne walidain ke darmiyan ghair shadi shuda ho, phir Allah use shauhar ata farmaye aur use us se maal aur aulad ata farmaye. Phir woh gusse mein kahe: Main ne tum se kabhi khair nahin dekhi.' Ishaq ne kaha: Aise hi Sufyan ne kaha ya isi ki manind."
"609","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas se guzre jabke ham auraton mein thin aur hamen salam farmaya. Asma ne kaha: To ham ne Aap ko jawab diya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Mun'im ki nashukri se bacho.' Phir unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki. Aur Aap ne farmaya: Phir woh gusse mein Allah ki qasam khae aur kahe: Main ne tum se kabhi khair nahin dekhi."
"610","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas se guzre jabke ham hum umr ladkiyan thin. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Mun'im ki nashukri se bacho.' To main ne kaha: Mun'im ki nashukri kya hai? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Shayad tum mein se ek ki ghair shadi shuda muddat lambi ho yahan tak ke woh budhi ho jae baghair shadi ke, phir Allah use shauhar se shadi kara de. Phir woh gusse mein kahe: Main ne tum se kabhi khair nahin dekhi.'"
"611","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sanabil se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Subai'ah ne apne shauhar ki wafat ke bees raaton ya teees ke baad bachcha jana. Phir jab woh pak huin to shauharon ke liye taiyar huin. To un par yeh aib lagaya gaya. To unhon ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use kya rokta hai jabke us ki muddat poori ho chuki?'"
"612","[AI-translation] Sha'bi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman aur Ibn Abbas ne us aurat ke bare mein fatwa diya jis ka shauhar faut ho gaya ho. To unhon ne Umm Salamah ki taraf paigham bheja aur un se is ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Subai'ah ne apne shauhar ki wafat ke mahine aur isi ki manind ke baad bachcha jana. Phir jab woh janin aur pak huin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Jis se chaho nikah karo. Aur Aap ne nahin farmaya: Donon muddaton mein se aakhri."
"613","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sanabil bin Ba'kak se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"614","[AI-translation] Masruq aur Ibn Utbah se riwayat hai ke un donon ne Subai'ah bint Haris ko khat likha aur un se un ke muamle ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne un donon ko likha ke unhon ne apne shauhar ki wafat ke pachees raaton ke baad bachcha jana. To woh khair (nikah) talab karne ke liye taiyar huin. To un ke paas se Abu Sanabil guzre aur un se kaha: Tum ne jaldi ki; donon muddaton mein se aakhri ki iddat guzaro: chaar mahine dus din. To woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur kaha: Mere liye bakhshish ki dua farmayen Ya Rasulullah! To Aap ne farmaya: 'Aur woh kis wajah se?' Unhon ne kaha: To main ne Aap ko khabar batai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar tum naik mard pao to nikah karo.'"
"615","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Utbah ne Abdullah bin Arqam ko khat likha ke woh Subai'ah ke paas jayen aur un se is ke bare mein poochen jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen fatwa diya tha. Unhon ne da'wa kiya ke woh apne shauhar Sa'd bin Khaulah ke paas thin. To woh un se Hajjatul Wada' ke saal mein faut ho gae jabke woh hamilah thin. To unhon ne chand raaton ke baad hamal jana. Phir jab woh janin to taiyar huin. To un ke paas se Abu Sanabil guzre aur un se kaha: Shayad tum nikah ki ummeed rakhti ho. Nahin, Allah ki qasam! Yahan tak ke tum par tumhare shauhar ki wafat se chaar mahine dus din guzren. To woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur Aap ko woh bataya. To Aap ne un se farmaya: 'Tum halal ho chuki.'"
"616","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas aur Abu Hurairah se us aurat ke bare mein poocha gaya jis ka shauhar faut ho jae aur woh chaar mahine dus din se pahle bachcha jane. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Woh donon muddaton mein se aakhri ki iddat guzaregi. To Abu Salamah ne kaha: Jab woh jo us ke pet mein hai jan de to tehqeeq woh halal ho gai. To Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Main apne bhatije ke sath hun — yani: Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman. To unhon ne Umm Salamah ki taraf paigham bheja jabke woh masjid mein apne hujre mein thin aur un se is ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne bataya ke Subai'ah bint Haris ne apne shauhar ki wafat ke chand raaton ke baad bachcha jana. To un ke paas se Abu Sanabil bin Ba'kak guzre jab woh apne nifas se pak huin aur libas pahen aur surma laga chuki thin. To unhon ne un se kaha: Kya tum nikah chahti ho? Nahin yahan tak ke chaar mahine dus din poore karo. To woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur Aap ko woh bataya. To Aap ne unhen nikah ka hukm diya."
"617","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Marwan bin Hakam ne Abdullah bin Utbah ko Subai'ah ki taraf bheja taake woh un se un ke muamle ke bare mein poochen. To unhon ne wohi zikr kiya jo Abu Salamah ne un ke muamle mein kaha tha. Zuhri ne kaha: Un ke shauhar Sa'd bin Khaulah the; woh Fath ke saal mein faut hue aur Badri the."
"618","[AI-translation] Maimunah se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Us aurat ki misal jo ghair ghar walon ke liye zeenat mein itrati hai, Qayamat ke din andhere ki si hai; us ke liye koi noor nahin hai."
"619","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Koi aurat teen raaton se ziyada (maut par) sog na kare siwae shauhar par. To beshak woh us par chaar mahine dus din sog karegi. Aur woh surma na lagae, aur na ranga hua kapda pahne siwae asb ke kapde ke. Aur khushbu na lagae siwae haiz se taharat ke qareeb qust aur azfar ki thodi miqdar.'"
"620","[AI-translation] Hisham ne isi sanad se isi ki manind riwayat ki."
"621","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen hukm diya gaya ke ham shauhar par ihdad mein range kapde na pahnen siwae asb ke kapde ke."
"622","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen ihdad mein hukm diya gaya ke ham khushbu na lagayen siwae taharat ke qareeb kust aur azfar se."
"623","[AI-translation] Fatimah bint Qais se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Mere shauhar ne mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein teen talaqen din. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai. To Aap ne mere liye rehaish ya nafaqa muqarrar nahin farmaya. Mughirah ne kaha: To main Ibrahim ke paas aaya aur unhen woh bataya. To unhon ne kaha: Us ke liye rehaish aur nafaqa hai. To main ne unhen Sha'bi ka qaul bataya. Unhon ne kaha: Umar use us ke liye muqarrar farmate the. To Umar ne kaha: Ham apne Rabb ki Kitab aur apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat ko us aurat ke qaul se nahin chhodenge jise ham nahin jante shayad us ne yaad rakha ya bhool gai."
"624","[AI-translation] Fatimah bint Qais se riwayat hai ke unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein talaq di gai. To Aap ne un ke liye rehaish ya nafaqa muqarrar nahin farmaya. Aur Umar ne kaha: 'Ham Allah apne Rabb ki Kitab aur apne Nabi ki sunnat ko us aurat ke qaul se nahin chhodenge jise main nahin janta shayad woh bhool gai.'"
"625","[AI-translation] Sha'bi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Fatimah bint Qais ne bayan kiya ke us ke shauhar ne use teen talaqen din, aur beshak unhon ne apne chacha zad bhai, Ibn Umm Maktum ke paas iddat guzari."
"626","[AI-translation] Fatimah bint Qais se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Mere shauhar ne mujhe teen talaqen din. To main us ke wakeel ke paas aai aur us se nafaqa manga. To us ne kaha: Tumhare liye na rehaish hai aur na nafaqa. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur Aap ko woh bataya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Us ne sach kaha.'"
"627","[AI-translation] Fatimah bint Qais se riwayat hai ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain. To Aap ne un ke liye rehaish ya nafaqa muqarrar nahin farmaya."
"628","[AI-translation] Fatimah bint Qais se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Mere shauhar ne mujhe teen talaqen din. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mere liye rehaish ya nafaqa muqarrar nahin farmaya."
"629","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se Fatimah bint Qais se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne us ke munh se kitab likhi."
"630","[AI-translation] Fatimah bint Qais se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Bani Makhzum mein se ek aadmi ke paas thi aur us ne mujhe baain talaq di. To main ne us ke ghar walon ki taraf paigham bheja aur un se nafaqa manga. To unhon ne kaha: Ham par tumhara koi nafaqa nahin hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Un par tumhara koi nafaqa nahin hai. Aur tum par iddat hai. To Umm Shareek ki taraf muntaqil ho jao aur hamen apne nafs se mahroom na rakho.' Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Umm Shareek ke paas us ke bhai aate jate hain jo pahle Muhajireen mein se hain. To Ibn Umm Maktum ki taraf muntaqil ho jao; beshak us ki beenai chali gai hai. Phir jab tum apne kapde utaro to woh tum se kuch nahin dekhega. Aur hamen apne nafs se mahroom na rakho.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab main halal hui to Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan aur Abu Jahm Adawi ne mujhe paigham bheja. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Raha Mu'awiyah to faqeer hai us ke paas kuch nahin hai. Aur raha Abu Jahm to woh apna aasa apne kandhe se nahin utarta. To tum Usamah bin Zaid ke bare mein kya kahte ho?' Un ke ghar walon ne use napasand kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Main siwae us ke nikah nahin karungi jis ki taraf Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe bulaya. To main ne Usamah bin Zaid se nikah kiya."
"631","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Amr ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ibrahim Taimi ne kaha: Aishah ne kaha: 'Aey Fatimah! Allah se daro; tehqeeq tum ne jana woh kya tha.'"
"632","[AI-translation] Fadl ne izafa kiya: Aur Muhammad bin Amr ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ibrahim se, Ibn Abbas se Allah ke qaul: «لَا تُخْرِجُوهُنَّ مِنْ بُيُوتِهِنَّ وَلَا يَخْرُجْنَ إِلَّا أَنْ يَأْتِينَ بِفَاحِشَةٍ مُبَيِّنَةٍ» [65-At-Talaq:1] ke bare mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Wazeh fahisha yeh hai ke woh apne ghar walon par jahalat kare. Phir jab woh aisa kare to tehqeeq un ke liye use nikalna halal ho gaya.'"
"633","[AI-translation] Nadr ne Muhammad bin Amr se isi sanad se isi ki manind riwayat ki."
"634","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abdur Rahman bin Asim bin Sabit ne bataya ke Fatimah bint Qais — Dahhak bin Qais ki bahan — ne unhen bataya aur woh Bani Makhzum mein se ek aadmi ke paas thin. Unhon ne unhen bataya ke us ne unhen teen talaqen din aur baaz ghazwat mein nikla. Aur us ne apne wakeel ko hukm diya ke unhen baaz nafaqa de. Rawi ne kaha: To unhon ne use thoda samjha. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwiyon mein se ek ke paas chali gayin. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dakhil hue jabke woh un ke paas thin. To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Yeh Fatimah bint Qais hain; falan ne unhen teen talaqen di hain aur un ke liye baaz nafaqa ka hukm diya hai. To unhon ne use radd kar diya aur da'wa kiya ke woh cheez hai jo us ne un par ehsan ki. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us ne sach kaha.' Aur Aap ne un se farmaya: 'Umm Maktum ki taraf muntaqil ho jao aur un ke paas iddat guzaro.' Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak woh aisi aurat hain jin ke paas aane wale kasrat se hain. To Abdullah bin Umm Maktum ki taraf muntaqil ho jao aur un ke paas iddat guzaro.' To woh Abdullah bin Umm Maktum ki taraf muntaqil huin aur un ke paas iddat guzari. Phir jab un ki iddat poori hui to Abu Jahm bin Huzaifah, aur Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan ne unhen paigham bheja. To unhon ne is mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mashwara manga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Raha Abu Jahm bin Huzaifah to aisa aadmi hai mujhe tum par us ke aasa ki sakhti ka khauf hai. Aur raha Mu'awiyah to aisa aadmi hai mujhe maal se khauf hai.' To Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se nikah kiya."
"635","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Abu Amr bin Hafs bin Mughirah Ali bin Abi Talib ke sath Yaman ki taraf nikle. To unhon ne Fatimah bint Qais ki taraf us talaq ko bheja jo un ki talaq mein se baqi thi. Aur Haris bin Hisham, aur Ayyash bin Abi Rabi'ah ne un ke liye nafaqa ka hukm diya. To un donon ne un se kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tumhare liye nafaqa nahin hai siwae is ke ke tum hamilah ho. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur Aap ko woh bataya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhare liye nafaqa nahin hai. To Ibn Umm Maktum ke paas iddat guzaro.' Aur woh nabina hain; woh apne kapde un ke paas utartin aur woh unhen nahin dekhte. Phir jab un ki iddat poori hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ka Usamah bin Zaid se nikah kar diya. To yeh Marwan tak pahuncha. To unhon ne Qabeesah bin Zu'aib ko un ki taraf bheja taake woh un se is hadees ke bare mein poochen. To unhon ne unhen bayan ki. To Marwan ne kaha: Ham ne yeh hadees siwae ek aurat ke nahin suni; ham us hifazat ko lenge jis par ham ne logon ko paya. To Fatimah tak Marwan ka qaul pahuncha. To unhon ne kaha: Mere aur tumhare darmiyan Quran hai. Allah Azza wa Jalla ne apni Kitab mein farmaya: «وَلَا يَخْرُجْنَ» [65-At-Talaq:1] apne gharon se «إِلَّا أَنْ يَأْتِينَ بِفَاحِشَةٍ مُبَيِّنَةٍ» [4-An-Nisa:19] yahan tak ke pahunche: «لَعَلَّ اللَّهَ يُحْدِثُ بَعْدَ ذَلِكَ أَمْرًا» [65-At-Talaq:1]. To unhon ne kaha: Yeh us ke liye hai jis ke liye us par rujoo hai. To teen ke baad kaun sa muamla paida hoga? To tum un par kharch kaise karoge siwae is ke ke woh hamilah hon? To woh unhen kis par rokenge?"
"636","[AI-translation] Maimun bin Mihran se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id bin Musayyib se teen talaq wali ke bare mein poocha: Woh kahan iddat guzaregi? To unhon ne kaha: 'Apne shauhar ke ghar mein.' To main ne un se kaha: To Fatimah bint Qais ki hadees kahan hai? Unhon ne kaha: 'Woh aisi aurat hai jis ne logon ko fitne mein dala; woh tez zaban thi' — ya unhon ne kaha: 'Woh aisi aurat thi jis ki zaban mein us ke susral par kuch tha.'"
"637","[AI-translation] Maimun bin Mihran se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id bin Musayyib ko Fatimah bint Qais ki hadees sunai. To unhon ne kaha: 'Woh aisi aurat hai jis ne logon ko fitne mein dala.'"
"638","[AI-translation] Maimun bin Mihran se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Madina aaya aur wahan ke sab se bade faqeeh ke bare mein poocha. To mujhe Sa'id bin Musayyib ki taraf bheja gaya. To main ne un se teen talaq wali ke bare mein poocha: Woh kahan iddat guzaregi? To unhon ne kaha: 'Apne shauhar ke ghar mein.' Main ne kaha: To beshak Fatimah bint Qais — Dahhak bin Qais ki bahan — ko un ke shauhar ne teen talaqen din, to unhon ne Ibn Umm Maktum ke ghar mein iddat guzari. To unhon ne kaha: 'Woh tez zaban aurat thi; to use Ibn Umm Maktum ke hathon par rakha gaya.'"
"639","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne apni biwi se zihar kiya. Phir us ne use chaand ki roshni mein dekha, to woh use achchi lagi aur us ne us se jimak kiya. To woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko bataya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya Allah Azza wa Jalla ne nahin farmaya «مِنْ قَبْلِ أَنْ يَتَمَاسَّا»? To us ne kaha: Main ne use dekha aur woh mujhe achchi lagi. To Aap ne farmaya: Ruko yahan tak ke kaffara do."
"640","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salamah bin Sakhr se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne apni biwi se zihar kiya. Phir main ne us se jimak kiya. To main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya. To Aap ne mujhe hukm diya ke saath miskeenon ko khana khilaun."
"641","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Talaq Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane aur Umar ki hukumat ke do saal mein, teen talaq ek thi. To Umar ne kaha: Beshak tumhare liye talaq mein tahammul tha. To tum ne apne tahammul mein jaldi ki. Aur ham ne tum par woh jari kar diya jo tum ne jaldi ki."
"642","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai ke Abu Sahba ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Apni baton mein se lao: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr ke zamane mein teen talaq ek na thi? Woh aisa tha. Phir jab Umar ke zamane mein aaya to log talaq mein pai dar pai lage. To unhon ne un par use jari kar diya."
"643","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai ke Abu Sahba ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Kya tum nahin jante ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr, aur Umar ki hukumat ke teen saal mein teen talaq ek thi? To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Han."
"644","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Woh jis se suhbat nahin ki gai, jab teen us par jama ki jayen to woh us par waqe hongi."
"645","[AI-translation] Hasan ne kaha: To main ne woh Tawus ko sunaya. To unhon ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Ibn Abbas ko use ek qarar dete suna. Rawi ne kaha: Aur Umar ne kaha: Ek, agarche us ne unhen jama kiya."
"646","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij ne kaha: Mujhe Dawud bin Abi Hind ne Yazid bin Abi Maryam se, Abu Iyaz se, Ibn Abbas se bataya ke unhon ne kaha: Woh jis se suhbat nahin ki gai, aur woh jis se suhbat ki gai, teen mein barabar hain."
"647","[AI-translation] Ubadah bin Samit se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Mere dadaon mein se ek aadmi ne apni biwi ko hazaar talaqen din. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use jari farmaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare walid ne Allah se taqwa nahin kiya to Allah ne us ke liye nikalne ki jagah nahin banai. Us se teen juda ho gayin aur baqi ziyadati hain; us ne Allah ki ayaton ko mazaq banaya."
"648","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: (Tum mein se behtareen woh jinka mahr aasan ho). Rawi ne kaha: To Mujahid kahta tha: Agar ek dirham ho to woh halal hai."
"649","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham Ibn Abbas ke sath Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja Maimunah ke janaze mein Sarif mein hazir hue. To unhon ne kaha: Yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja hain. Phir jab tum un ka janaza uthao to use na hilao, na use jhatka do, aur narmi karo. Kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki nau pakeeza biwiyan thin; Aap aath ke liye bari muqarrar farmate aur ek ke liye bari muqarrar na farmate. Ata ne kaha: Jis ke liye Aap bari muqarrar na farmate, hamen pahunchta hai ke woh Safiyyah bint Huyay bin Akhtab thin."
"650","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni beti Zainab ko un ke shauhar Abul Aas bin Rabi' ko do saal ke baad pahle nikah ke sath wapas farmaya."
"651","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ishaq ne isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat ki, aur izafa kiya: Unhon ne kaha: Aur kuch naya nahin kiya. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen is se pahle apne paas rakha tha."
"652","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Qutailah, Ash'as bin Qais ki bahan se nikah farmaya. Lekin Aap unhen ikhtiyar dene se pahle wafat pa gae. To Allah ne Aap ko un se bari kar diya."
"653","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ma'iz se farmaya jab unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne zina kiya: Shayad tum ne chhua ya dekha ya bosa liya. Rawi ne kaha: Goya Aap dare ke woh nahin janta ke zina kya hai."
"654","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein nikah kiya, aur woh Islam la chuki thi. To us ka shauhar aaya aur kaha: Beshak main us ke sath Islam laya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use us ke pahle shauhar se cheen liya."
"655","[AI-translation] Isra'il ne isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat ki."
